  {
   "id": "rv-there-yet-373580@1.4.1",
   "gameId": "rv-there-yet-373580",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.4.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-29T14:11:02.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Gurajchaka childs!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's the update y'all have been waiting for: Full cross-play support is here! And so are the PS5 and Nintendo Switch 2 versions of the game - so you and your friends have more ways to play!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Not only that, but you'll be happy to hear that a few more bug fixes have also gone into this update to. So I'll include these patch notes below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But thank you all once again for the support you have shown us over this past year. I know we've said it many times before but it really does mean a lot! And we really look forward to making more fun games for you in the future.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Steam Patch: 1.4.1 (29/10/2026)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Xbox Patch 1.4.1 (29/10/2026)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Full cross-play support between all platforms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added join by IP support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added join by code support",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed achievements not working for clients including: \"Absolute Calm\", \"Jesus\", and \"fps_doug\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minesweeper now only requires you to set off 5 mines instead of 50",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed golf ball rolling into water causing softlock",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Made usability improvements to waving",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added more options to online search filters including: \"Session length\", \"Number of player\", and \"Open slots\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added controller vibrations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changes to controller aim-sensitivity, no longer locked behind framerate",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Networking improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor UI tweaks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor localization updates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other general bugfixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
